sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant C as Client
    participant R as Runtime
    participant V as VAD
    participant T as Turn Manager
    participant X as Cancellation Coordinator
    participant L as LLM
    participant S as TTS
    U->>C: Speaks during assistant playback
    C->>R: Microphone frames
    R->>V: Audio frames
    V-->>T: Speech-start candidate
    T->>T: Confirm barge-in policy
    T->>X: Cancel response_id
    X->>L: Cancel generation
    X->>S: Cancel synthesis
    X->>R: Stop accepting response chunks
    R-->>C: response.cancelled
    C->>C: Discard late chunks for cancelled response
    R->>V: Continue forwarding user audio
    V-->>T: Utterance finalized
    T->>L: New user turn can proceed
